@schaumburg_lippe_coalition_menu


- @spd_majority_slippe
- @soc_lib_slippe
- @odd_left_slippe
- @dvp_slippe
- @nsdap_slippe
- @social_monarchism_lets_gooooooooo


@spd_majority_slippe
title: We can form a majority government on our own.
view-if: spd_r_schaumburg_lippe >= 50
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "SPD"; schaum_lippe_spd = 1; ddp_relation -= 2


@soc_lib_slippe
title: A coalition with the DDP
subtitle: Classic one.
view-if: (spd_r_schaumburg_lippe + ddp_r_schaumburg_lippe) >= 50 and ddp_relation > 15
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "Social-Liberal"; schaum_lippe_spd = 1; schaum_lippe_ddp = 1



@odd_left_slippe
title: We could form a government with the KPD?
subtitle: Odd one.
view-if: left_coalition_schaumburg_lippe >= 50 and kpd_relation >= 85
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "Left"; schaum_lippe_spd = 1; schaum_lippe_kpd = 1


@dvp_slippe
title: The DVP can assemble a majority
view-if: dvp_coalition_schaumburg_lippe >= 50
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "Right"; schaum_lippe_dvp = 1; schaum_lippe_dnvp = 1; schaum_lippe_lvp = 1; schaum_lippe_lb = 2; schaum_lippe_cnbl = 2; schaum_lippe_hb = 2; schaum_lippe_true_other = 2


@nsdap_slippe
title: The Fascists will rule in our former stronghold
subtitle: The end is neigh...
view-if: right_coalition_schaumburg_lippe >= 50
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "Far-Right"; schaum_lippe_dvp = 1; schaum_lippe_dnvp = 1; schaum_lippe_nsdap = 1; schaum_lippe_nsfb = 1; schaum_lippe_lb = 2; schaum_lippe_cnbl = 2; schaum_lippe_hb = 2; schaum_lippe_true_other = 2


@social_monarchism_lets_gooooooooo
title: What about a coalition with the DNVP?
subtitle: We could need their support...
view-if: socmon_coalition_schaumburg_lippe >= 50
choose-if: ddp_relation > 15 and dvp_relation > 15 and dnvp_relation > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if ddp_relation <= 15: The DDP thinks you're crazy. ?][? if dvp_relation <= 15: The DVP is opposed to this ?][? if dnvp_relation <= 0: We need better relations with the DNVP ?]
  
on-arrival: schaumburg_lippe_election_2_trigger_time = time + 48; schaum_lippe_gov = "Social-Monarchist"; schaum_lippe_spd = 1; schaum_lippe_ddp = 1; schaum_lippe_dvp = 1; schaum_lippe_dnvp = 1; schaum_lippe_lb = 2; kpd_relation -= 2

Social-Fascism confirmed, something, something...














  
